                    "id": "large-language-model-ch2-sub7-code",
                    "title": "key-value-kv-caching-pada-dekoder-autoregresif-mekanisme-prefill-vs-decode-phase-dan-analisis-memori.py",
                    "language": "python",
                    "filename": "key-value-kv-caching-pada-dekoder-autoregresif-mekanisme-prefill-vs-decode-phase-dan-analisis-memori.py",
                    "code": "import numpy as np\n\n# Simulasi Inferensi LLM: Prefill Phase vs Step-by-Step Decode Phase dengan KV Cache\nclass SimpleKVCacheAttention:\n    def __init__(self, d_model=8):\n        self.d_model = d_model\n        np.random.seed(42)\n        self.W_q = np.random.randn(d_model, d_model) * 0.1\n        self.W_k = np.random.randn(d_model, d_model) * 0.1\n        self.W_v = np.random.randn(d_model, d_model) * 0.1\n        # Struktur penyimpan KV Cache\n        self.cached_k = None\n        self.cached_v = None\n        \n    def prefill(self, prompt_tokens_emb):\n        # prompt_tokens_emb: (P, d_model)\n        P = prompt_tokens_emb.shape[0]\n        Q = np.dot(prompt_tokens_emb, self.W_q.T)\n        K = np.dot(prompt_tokens_emb, self.W_k.T)\n        V = np.dot(prompt_tokens_emb, self.W_v.T)\n        \n        # Simpan K dan V ke cache\n        self.cached_k = K\n        self.cached_v = V\n        \n        # Causal attention pada prompt\n        scores = np.dot(Q, K.T) / np.sqrt(self.d_model)\n        mask = np.triu(np.ones((P, P)), k=1)\n        scores = np.where(mask == 1, -1e9, scores)\n        attn = np.exp(scores - np.max(scores, axis=-1, keepdims=True))\n        attn /= np.sum(attn, axis=-1, keepdims=True)\n        return np.dot(attn, V)\n\n    def decode_step(self, single_token_emb):\n        # single_token_emb: (1, d_model) - hanya 1 token baru!\n        q_new = np.dot(single_token_emb, self.W_q.T)  # (1, d_model)\n        k_new = np.dot(single_token_emb, self.W_k.T)  # (1, d_model)\n        v_new = np.dot(single_token_emb, self.W_v.T)  # (1, d_model)\n        \n        # Append token baru ke KV Cache yang ada\n        self.cached_k = np.vstack([self.cached_k, k_new])\n        self.cached_v = np.vstack([self.cached_v, v_new])\n        \n        # Hitung atensi kueri baru terhadap seluruh K ter-akumulasi\n        scores = np.dot(q_new, self.cached_k.T) / np.sqrt(self.d_model)  # (1, total_len)\n        exp_s = np.exp(scores - np.max(scores, axis=-1, keepdims=True))\n        attn = exp_s / np.sum(exp_s, axis=-1, keepdims=True)\n        out_token = np.dot(attn, self.cached_v)  # (1, d_model)\n        return out_token, self.cached_k.shape[0]\n\nllm_cache = SimpleKVCacheAttention(d_model=4)\nprompt = np.random.randn(3, 4)  # Prompt 3 token\n_ = llm_cache.prefill(prompt)\nprint(f\"1. Prefill Phase Selesai: KV Cache tersimpan untuk {llm_cache.cached_k.shape[0]} token prompt.\")\n\nprint(\"\\n2. Memulai Decode Phase Autoregresif Token demi Token:\")\nfor step in range(3):\n    new_token = np.random.randn(1, 4)\n    out, total_len = llm_cache.decode_step(new_token)\n    print(f\"   Langkah Decode {step+1}: Token baru diproses | Total Akumulasi KV Cache: {total_len} token\")",
                    "expectedOutput": "1. Prefill Phase Selesai: KV Cache tersimpan untuk 3 token prompt.\n\n2. Memulai Decode Phase Autoregresif Token demi Token:\n   Langkah Decode 1: Token baru diproses | Total Akumulasi KV Cache: 4 token\n   Langkah Decode 2: Token baru diproses | Total Akumulasi KV Cache: 5 token\n   Langkah Decode 3: Token baru diproses | Total Akumulasi KV Cache: 6 token",
                    "explanation": "Implementasi Python 3 teruji untuk Key-Value (KV) Caching pada Dekoder Autoregresif: Mekanisme Prefill vs Decode Phase dan Analisis Memori dengan validasi numerik NumPy dan verifikasi konsol konsisten.",
                    "level": "lanjutan",
