            "id": "large-language-model-ch5-sub5",
            "slug": "compute-optimal-scaling-laws-chinchilla-hoffmann-et-al-2022-vs-kaplan-et-al-2020",
            "title": "5.5. Compute-Optimal Scaling Laws: Chinchilla Hoffmann et al. (2022) vs Kaplan et al. (2020)",
            "orderIndex": 5,
            "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam Compute-Optimal Scaling Laws: Chinchilla Hoffmann et al. (2022) vs Kaplan et al. (2020): formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
