                    "expectedOutput": "Step     | Cosine Decay LR    | WSD Schedule LR \n------------------------------------------------\n50       | 1.50e-04           | 1.50e-04          \n100      | 3.00e-04           | 3.00e-04          \n300      | 2.68e-04           | 3.00e-04          \n600      | 1.65e-04           | 3.00e-04          \n850      | 5.86e-05           | 2.32e-04          \n950      | 3.32e-05           | 9.75e-05          \n1000     | 3.00e-05           | 3.00e-05",
