            "id": "large-language-model-ch7-sub3",
            "slug": "deepspeed-zero-zero-redundancy-optimizer-partisi-optimizer-states-gradients-dan-parameters-rajbhandari-et-al-2020",
            "title": "7.3. DeepSpeed ZeRO (Zero Redundancy Optimizer): Partisi Optimizer States, Gradients, dan Parameters (Rajbhandari et al. 2020)",
            "orderIndex": 3,
            "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam DeepSpeed ZeRO (Zero Redundancy Optimizer): Partisi Optimizer States, Gradients, dan Parameters (Rajbhandari et al. 2020): formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
