            "title": "7.6. Pipeline Parallelism: GPipe Schedule, 1F1B (One-Forward-One-Backward), dan Mitigasi Pipeline Bubble",
            "orderIndex": 6,
            "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam Pipeline Parallelism: GPipe Schedule, 1F1B (One-Forward-One-Backward), dan Mitigasi Pipeline Bubble: formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
