            "id": "large-language-model-ch8-sub7",
            "slug": "post-training-quantization-ptq-gptq-optimal-brain-surgeon-awq-activation-aware-weight-quantization-dan-smoothquant",
            "title": "8.7. Post-Training Quantization (PTQ): GPTQ (Optimal Brain Surgeon), AWQ (Activation-aware Weight Quantization), dan SmoothQuant",
            "orderIndex": 7,
            "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam Post-Training Quantization (PTQ): GPTQ (Optimal Brain Surgeon), AWQ (Activation-aware Weight Quantization), dan SmoothQuant: formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
            "learningObjectives": [
                "Memahami konsep fundamental dan formulasi analitis Post-Training Quantization (PTQ): GPTQ (Optimal Brain Surgeon), AWQ (Activation-aware Weight Quantization), dan SmoothQuant",
                "Menguasai alur komputasi dan implementasi modul kode Python",
                "Mampu mendeteksi serta memitigasi jebakan teknis umum (common pitfalls)"
            ],
