            "orderIndex": 8,
            "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam QLoRA: Fine-Tuning 4-bit NormalFloat (NF4), Double Quantization (DQ), dan Paged Optimizers (Dettmers et al. 2023): formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
