            "title": "9.2. Taksonomi Dataset SFT: Natural Instructions, FLAN (Wei et al. 2022), Self-Instruct, dan ShareGPT",
            "orderIndex": 2,
            "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam Taksonomi Dataset SFT: Natural Instructions, FLAN (Wei et al. 2022), Self-Instruct, dan ShareGPT: formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
