            "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam Reinforcement Learning from AI Feedback (RLAIF) dan Constitutional AI (Anthropic - Bai et al. 2022): formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
