            "id": "large-language-model-ch13-sub10",
            "slug": "proyek-implementasi-mandiri-streamingllm-attention-sink-sliding-window-cache-engine-mandiri-numpy",
            "title": "13.10. Proyek Implementasi Mandiri: StreamingLLM Attention Sink & Sliding Window Cache Engine Mandiri NumPy",
            "orderIndex": 10,
            "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam Proyek Implementasi Mandiri: StreamingLLM Attention Sink & Sliding Window Cache Engine Mandiri NumPy: formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
